# LESS configuration (window, font, colors, keys).
#
# This file was created at the following path because LESS couldn't find
# a configuration file:
#
#   {[path]s}
#
# It is empty on purpose: LESS ships with its own defaults. Only add the
# options you want to change, one `key = value` per line, for example:
#
# font-size = 15
# window-padding-x = 8
#
# The font chosen with :Font is stored in ~/.config/less/font.ghostty.
# Neovim settings live in ~/.config/less/nvim.
#
# The syntax and all options are those of Ghostty, which LESS is built on:
# https://ghostty.org/docs/config
#
# Reload with Command + Shift + comma. Some options only apply to new
# windows or after a restart.
